# Opinion

Meeting: 0029-switch-calendar-backend-to-postgres
Agent: Critic
Task: switch calendar backend to postgres
Context: Moving to Postgres risks breaking the simple demo path if defaults are unclear.
Position: Auto-configure in-container Postgres and document how `DATABASE_URL` is set so users aren’t surprised.
Recommendations:
- Keep in-memory storage available for quick tests.
- Document the entrypoint behavior and how to override DB settings.
- Ensure readiness checks fail loudly when Postgres is unreachable.
